   - **Assertion**: `playerConto.x` strictly equal `-234` (was `-226`).
   - **Cause**: Upstream angle and position drift accumulated during the 5-step Scenario A pre-roll due to Case A compound assignments.
   - **Fix**: Reclassified compound assignment sites in [`Craft.js`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Craft.js) to Case B.

